Z||000000||loafer87gt||03-27-2000||12:16 AM||||Well, we just finished up our annual Street Hockey tournament this weekend. This is a picture of my team "Slaves to the Draught". We ended up getting sponsered by Labatts and got a sh*tload of free beer from them. We ended up getting a severe beating (7-nothing) because our goalie, the guy in the mange coat, passed out in net!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smurfs.jpg"> <BR>It was hilarious when we went to the bar dressed in the full garb after our first game, the ladies loved it! ||||reg||10
