Z||000007||loafer87gt||03-29-2000||01:06 AM||||Olympic: do you remember that Labatts XXX beer? 7.3 % !! That stuff would knock you on your a**! I can remember my first big bender when my older brother took me to a party and gave me a six pack of this stuff. At the end of the night I had picked up some 300+ pound chick who I thought at the time looked pretty hot! Stupid beer goggles!<P>On a sidenote, we got our prize for the best costume, LOL. What a joke, 5 christian rock CD's and a box of chocolates. I'll hang on to them and hand them out as christmas presents at the end of the year. ||||reg||1
